  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/colorado-of-equipment",
  "description": "Colorado of Equipment: equipment rental invoices against the agreed day, week and month rates, the off-rent date and the hours the machine was used: billed above the cheapest rate combination, billed after it was called off, the same days billed twice, rentals sitting idle, and rentals with no job. Drafts credit requests. Never calls a rental off or pays.",
